      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "<a id=\"_Toc492473228\">H 14558</a> – And by this chain, from Hafs, who has reported the following:",
          "<span class=\"first-chapter-phrase\"><span class=\"first-in-chapter character-a\">A</span>bu Abdullah</span><sup>asws</sup> said: ‘The example of the people of the Day of Judgement when they stand before the Lord<sup>azwj</sup> of the Worlds, where they will have no space for movement for themselves except for their feet, like the arrows (tightly packed) in the quiver, not having the ability for going over there or over there’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "110. And by this chain, from Hafs, who has reported the following: Abu Abdullah (a.s.) said: ‘The example of the people of the Day of Judgement when they stand before the Lord (azwj) of the Worlds, where they will have no space for movement for themselves except for their feet, like the arrows (tightly packed) in the quiver, not having the ability for going over there or over there’."
        ]
      }
